<div class="op-haki-body">
<header class="op-haki-overview"><strong>{{actor.name}}</strong><div class="op-haki-stages">{{#each stages}}<span class="{{#if active}}active{{/if}}">{{label}}<small>{{range}}</small></span>{{/each}}</div><div class="op-haki-points"><span>Estágio <b>{{stage}}</b></span><span>Total atual <b>{{total}}</b></span><span>Distribuídos <b>{{spent}}</b></span><span>Disponíveis <b>{{remaining}}</b></span></div></header>
<nav class="op-haki-tabs" aria-label="Tipo de Haki">{{#each focuses}}<button type="button" data-action="focus" data-focus="{{id}}" aria-pressed="{{active}}">{{label}}</button>{{/each}}</nav>
{{#unless awakened}}<p class="op-hint">O despertar precisa da autorização do Narrador antes de distribuir PA.</p>{{/unless}}{{#if kingLocked}}<p class="op-hint">Haki do Rei sem autorização do Narrador. Consulte os talentos abaixo.</p>{{/if}}
<div class="op-haki-tools">{{#if canManage}}<button type="button" data-action="manage">Narrador · despertar e PA</button>{{/if}}<label class="sr-only" for="haki-search-{{actor.id}}">Buscar talento</label><input id="haki-search-{{actor.id}}" type="search" data-haki-search placeholder="Buscar talento…"><span data-haki-search-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></span><button type="button" data-action="zoom" data-step="-0.1" aria-label="Diminuir árvore">−</button><button type="button" data-action="zoom" data-step="0.1" aria-label="Ampliar árvore">+</button></div>
<div class="op-haki-layout"><div class="op-haki-viewport"><div class="op-haki-canvas" style="width:{{width}}px;height:{{height}}px">
{{#each bands}}<div class="op-haki-band" style="top:{{y0}}px;height:{{height}}px"><span>{{label}}</span></div>{{/each}}{{#each branches}}<strong class="op-haki-branch" style="left:{{x}}px">{{ramo}}</strong>{{/each}}
<svg class="op-haki-links" width="{{width}}" height="{{height}}" aria-hidden="true">{{#each links}}<path d="{{path}}" class="{{#if learned}}learned{{/if}}"/>{{/each}}</svg>
{{#each nodes}}<button type="button" class="op-haki-node {{state}} {{#if learned}}learned{{/if}} {{#if selected}}selected{{/if}}" style="left:{{x}}px;top:{{y}}px" data-action="node" data-node="{{id}}" data-search="{{search}}" aria-pressed="{{selected}}" aria-label="{{name}} · {{rank}} de {{maxRank}} formas · {{cost}} PA · {{stateLabel}}" title="{{stateLabel}}{{#if reason}} · {{reason}}{{/if}}"><strong>{{name}}</strong><span class="op-haki-stars" aria-hidden="true">{{#each stars}}<i class="fa-solid fa-star {{#if filled}}filled{{/if}}"></i>{{/each}}</span><small>{{cost}}</small><span class="op-haki-node-state" aria-hidden="true">{{stateLabel}}</span></button>{{/each}}
</div></div>
<aside class="op-haki-inspector" aria-label="Consulta do talento">{{#with selectedNode}}<h2>{{name}}</h2><p>{{rank}}/{{maxRank}} formas aprendidas</p><dl><dt>Próxima forma</dt><dd>{{nextForm}}</dd><dt>Custo por forma</dt><dd>{{cost}} PA</dd><dt>Estágio exigido</dt><dd>{{requiredStage}}</dd></dl><h3>Pré-requisitos</h3><ul>{{#each prerequisiteNames}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{else}}<li>Nenhum talento anterior</li>{{/each}}</ul><p class="op-hint">{{source}}</p>{{#if canBuy}}<p>Saldo após aquisição: <strong>{{nextRemaining}} PA</strong></p><button type="button" data-action="buy">Aprender {{nextForm}}</button>{{else}}<p class="op-haki-reason" role="status">{{#if reason}}{{reason}}{{else}}Todas as formas aprendidas.{{/if}}</p>{{/if}}<details open><summary>Regra do talento</summary><div class="op-book-text">{{{description}}}</div></details>{{else}}<h2>Árvore de Haki</h2><p>Selecione um talento para consultar custo e requisitos. A consulta não gasta PA.</p><p class="op-hint">Arraste o espaço vazio para mover. Use as setas do teclado entre os talentos e Enter para consultar.</p>{{/with}}</aside></div>
</div>
